WEBVTT

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.080
Excuse me.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:10.980
Director Yorgo? Where are you going?

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.150
The Wodon Diet has summoned me.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.830
They want an explanation regarding all the damage the Jinx has caused.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:32.850
The Jinx's specialism as an anti-Thanatos platform means that it auto-fires regardless of the presence of buildings or people!

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.640
You knew this, of course, Elenfriet.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:40.730
Don't use the Jinx until I return.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:54.430
I'll show Director Yorgo that I'm better than Professor Lein!

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.910
The Thanatos will appear in five seconds.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.130
Initiating Combat Mode.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:04.610
Why?

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.630
My Jinx should be perfect...

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.080
Phase 11: Dark Clouds

00:02:55.420 --> 00:03:00.840
We've heard that the village of Nabal has been badly damaged by the Jinx; what is your response?

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:04.110
The Jinx were mobilized to fight the Thanatos.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.780
Minor damage was inevitable.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:10.650
But the majority of the Jinx's attacks were ineffective!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.310
The village was burned to the ground!

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:21.050
There are also rumors that some of the Jinx were destroyed by the Thanatos.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.840
We have no reliable information to that effect.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:29.280
However, the fact is that the Jinx have gained victories against the Thanatos all across the country.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:34.770
The Jinx are currently offline and undergoing additional improvements.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:41.150
In just a few days, you will get to see an even more effective version of the Jinx.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:46.890
What proof do you have that the Jinx will be useful in the future?

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.760
With the Knights of the Silver Tree unable...

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:54.260
to deal with all the Thanatos by themselves, the effectiveness of the Jinx is undeniable.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.060
Elenfriet.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:16.460
Maintaining our battle lines is proving impossible.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.630
Order the retreat.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.490
The Jinx are being destroyed one after another?

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:25.660
What is the meaning of this?

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.860
Weren't they taken offline?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.390
There are reports that towns everywhere are under attack!

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.320
Director Yorgo, explain yourself!

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.830
Elenfriet...

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.460
Damn it... damn it to Hell!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:02.600
Jinx damage rate: Ninety-nine point eight percent.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.990
The operation was an utter failure.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.860
What should I do? What should I do?

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.780
What should I do?

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.600
I can't face Director Yorgo like this.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.360
I know!

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.440
I need to do more research...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.160
And for that, I need some research materials.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:26.020
Wouldn't you agree?

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:35.350
Ah, the sun feels so good.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.350
Lein hasn't been back since last night.

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:42.020
I wonder if something's wrong...

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.100
When did he...

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.580
Do you like that chair?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:13.760
Jeez...

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.470
The whim of a cat.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.140
Those smell good.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.840
You came 'cause you smelled these?

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.390
I baked some scones.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:34.490
Lein will be tired when he gets back, so let's eat them together.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:40.800
The Jinx suffered a massive defeat, huh?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.310
Oh, Erwin.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.790
He doesn't like me, does he?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.810
Hey, Erwin.

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:03.530
You've come to welcome me home?

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.390
This place is peaceful.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:16.850
But if things continue like this, we may never be able to return to everyday life.

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:28.130
As I thought, the Jinx have incited the Thanatos.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.000
The Jinx?

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:31.700
Why?

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:36.710
The introduction of a potent medicine causes the disease to evolve to fight back.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:42.520
The Jinx have caused the Thanatos to increase in numbers and grow stronger.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:48.760
So the Jinx "wonder drug" is no longer effective.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.870
I hear that the Knights of the Silver Tree are also having problems all over the country.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.970
Everyone is suffering.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:00.120
Let's go fight too!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.990
Dammit, move!

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.790
The Orb Hunters!

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.080
There's no end to them!

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.170
Angie!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.130
Light of Purification...

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.520
Here you go, Angie.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:24.860
Thank you.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:29.410
Those Thanatos were tough.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:30.530
Yeah...

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.390
Jade?

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.990
The Jinx are Artifacts.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:48.730
If nobody fixes them, they'll remain broken forever.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:50.620
Jade...

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:55.620
Other Artifacts are like brothers to me.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.530
It pains me to see them like this.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:03.250
I wonder if he's okay...

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:08.850
I was just thinking about my lookalike.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:15.420
I think he's an Artifact created using the research they carried out on me.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:19.860
To me, he's like a twin brother.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:26.020
I wonder if somewhere out there, he's fighting the Thanatos too.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.630
Jade...

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.650
You're such a nice guy, Jade.

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:38.950
If he's your twin, maybe he has a kind heart like you.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.870
Angie...

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:46.860
Maybe he has somebody he wants to protect.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:48.960
I hope he does...

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:54.350
Somebody who warms his heart by being near him.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:05.270
Our village was attacked by Thanatos!

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.740
I beg you: let us see the Head of the Order.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:21.380
Mathius...

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:28.110
The world is enshrouded by the clouds of uncertainty... more than it ever has been before.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:33.160
For the sake of the world, we do what we must.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.580
Thank you for your many years of service.

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.130
You may go.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:12:00.620
You too should do what you must.

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:10.020
Hey, that's a pretty box.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.680
What is it?

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:17.870
The High Elder asked me to give this to Sir Mathius.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:22.110
But I can't find him, so I can't give it to him.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.950
Then, I'll deliver it for you.

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:26.920
You're busy with your job.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.540
Really?

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:30.110
Thanks.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.200
Leave it to me.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:43.500
I knew this day would come,

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:48.250
but now I can't do anything...

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.070
What's wrong, Mathius?

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.160
Rune?

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:56.270
Nothing. Really.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:59.280
And what's wrong with you?

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.910
This is from the High Elder. It's for you.

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.880
The High Elder?

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:10.690
Here you are, Mathius.

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:19.750
What's in it?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.410
How pretty!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:24.460
Is that for the ceremony?

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.020
No.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.710
This is a type of message.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.550
A message?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.760
You explain things in a funny way, Mathius.

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:41.120
I knew it. What a pretty dagger!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.010
It suits you.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:49.580
I never imagined you'd be the one to hand me this, Rune.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.330
Welcome home, Angelique.

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:00.500
Are you okay, Angie?

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.550
Yes.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.760
You must be tired.

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:04.880
I'll make some tea.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:07.350
Thank you, Nyx.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.520
I'll make you some sweets too.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:12.650
It's fine... you must be pretty tired too, Jade.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.890
Please rest.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.610
But I...

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:17.280
It's all right, Jade.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:20.520
I can make the tea myself.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:22.770
Please, sit and relax.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:26.340
But you must be tired too, Nyx...

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:27.990
I'm fine.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:31.310
I got home before you.

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:32.760
Where are Lein and Hyuuga?

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:35.000
They went to Frulil.

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:36.330
Frulil?

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:41.250
Yes, I received a message after you'd left this morning...

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.110
Lein?

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:52.780
Angie...

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:55.020
Aren't you worried about Frulil?

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:57.950
It's the village where you were born, isn't it?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.030
Yes.

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:01.860
But I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:04.390
Both Lein and Hyuuga are there.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:08.400
Let's go now, you two.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.010
Did something happen in Frulil?

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:13.180
No, Frulil is fine.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.690
But...

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:19.980
A large numbers of Thanatos appeared at the nearby Melrose Women's Academy.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:26.560
It seems as though a lot of the students are still inside.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:29.980
The Foundation has sent in the Jinx but...

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.270
The Jinx?

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.730
They probably won't last long.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.570
Lein and Hyuuga are on their way.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:40.360
Please be safe, everyone...

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.240
We got it!

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:54.750
Get out of here, now!

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.460
Lein!

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:08.430
It's no good! There are too many of them.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:11.270
There are more here too?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.020
Hyuuga!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.080
Lein!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:21.320
Lady Angelique!

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:24.460
Leave this to us. Save the rest of the students!

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:25.240
Right!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.270
Got it.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:27.810
Let's go, Angie!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.410
H...{?}

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:40.710
Headmistress!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:42.920
Angelique...

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.930
I'm so relieved you're here...

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:50.690
We're here now, so there's no need to worry.

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:51.980
Don't panic.

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:54.120
Thank you, Nyx.

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:57.550
But what should we do?

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:59.220
Angelique...

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.600
I can't find Hannah or Sally.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.430
Hannah and Sally?

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:07.580
They're probably still with the journalist who came to interview them...

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.750
Headmistress!

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.300
I'm fine.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.900
I'll take these two somewhere safe.

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:17.170
Then we'll look for Hannah and Sally.

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:22.310
Hannah, Sally... please be safe.

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:31.990
Hannah!

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:32.890
Sally!

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.380
Thanatos!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:41.260
Angelique... you go look for them.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.750
But...

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:44.840
We can't waste time!

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.240
I'll catch up.

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:48.600
Gotcha!

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:49.710
Angelique.

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:51.210
Don't do anything stupid.

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:54.600
If you meet any Thanatos, call me.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:55.860
Right!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:01.310
You need to pay attention.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:07.440
You seem to have escaped the Jinx, but now that you've appeared before me, you won't get away so easily!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.150
I'm appalled at my own weakness...

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:30.870
Hurry, you guys!

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:41.180
Get out of here!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:42.860
But...

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:45.730
This thing...

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:50.280
A Thanatos!

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:51.340
Bernal!

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.840
Hannah! Sally!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:53.900
Angie!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.980
Wait, I'll go get Nyx!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.280
There's no time to get Nyx.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:12.900
I have to...

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:25.190
I knew it... I can't even scratch an unwounded Thanatos.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:27.760
Angelique...

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:44.020
Light of Purification... save my precious friends!

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.190
Angie!

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:04.730
Thank you...

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.560
We were so scared!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.840
Hannah... Sally...

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.990
I'm so relieved!

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:15.480
Angelique...

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:23.260
I didn't think you'd come all this way just to save us.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.750
Bernal...

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:29.390
So you're the journalist the Headmistress mentioned?

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:30.930
How is the Headmistress?

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:32.180
She's fine.

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:35.110
Jade took her somewhere safe.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:37.330
I see... I'm glad.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:40.500
Are you hurt, Bernal?

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.810
I'm fine.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.500
Anyway, I'm sorry.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:48.820
I put you and your friends in danger.

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:51.630
Don't worry about it, Bernal.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:57.100
The Thanatos seem to have stopped attacking.

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:59.740
Let's try to find somewhere safer.

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:00.700
Good idea.

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:22.580
Angie!

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:25.260
Angelique!

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.320
Angelique!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.770
Bernal!

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:40.970
Stay still.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:43.080
Lady Angelique!

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.350
Angelique!

00:21:54.150 --> 00:21:55.920
I'll hit Angelique!

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:37.690
We need to get Angelique back!

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.740
Erwin, you help too!

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:41.540
At a time like this, even the aid of a cat can be useful.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:42.980
Amazing!

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:44.260
That was pretty clever.

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:46.260
Next time: The Captured Angelique.

00:23:46.310 --> 00:23:48.450
Take away all his points!
